OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after bus drives
OL,4,Awrong way on M67
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter a bus was seen travelling the
OL,8,Fwrong way on the M67 in Greater
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FWitnesses reported seeing the
OL,12,Fdouble-decker Bee Network vehicle near
OL,13,FHattersley roundabout at about 05:45
OL,14,FBST on Friday.
OL,16,FTransport for Greater Manchester (TfGM)
OL,17,Fsaid there were no passengers on board
OL,18,Fat the time.
OL,20,FThe bus operator, Metroline, is
OL,21,Fcarrying out a full investigation.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
